query
SELECT id FROM pwpv_upper WHERE upper(body) @@ ts_phrase('QUICK BROWN') ORDER BY id
----
id
1
2
5

statement error
SELECT id FROM pwpv_bare WHERE body @@ ts_phrase('quick brown')
----
db error: ERROR: ts_phrase on a column without positions needs the column's text in the index
HINT: Add `position` to the dictionary, keep the column's text in the index with `INCLUDE`, or query with a single-term ts_phrase / ts_like.


statement ok
DROP VIEW pwpv
